
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Discover BrightStart products and services.">
  <title>BrightStart | Welcome</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #172033;
      background: #f7f9fc;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf2;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #2563eb; }
    nav a {
      color: #263449;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 90px 7%;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e5efff, #f4f7ff);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 62px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      max-width: 800px;
    }
    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: #536176;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 23px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    section { padding: 65px 7%; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .section-title h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .section-title p { color: #64748b; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5eaf2;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #17203308;
    }
    .card .emoji { font-size: 34px; }
    .card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .card p { color: #64748b; }
    .about {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .about p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #536176;
    }
    .contact { text-align: center; }
    footer {
      padding: 25px 7%;
      text-align: center;
      background: #172033;
      color: white;
    }
    footer p { margin: 5px; }
    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      header { justify-content: center; }
      nav a { margin: 0 7px; font-size: 14px; }
      .hero { padding: 65px 6%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">BrightStart.</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#services">What We Offer</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <h1>A fresh start for great ideas.</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to BrightStart! Explore what we offer
        and discover how we can help you.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#services">Explore Our Offers</a>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <p>Discover our products and services.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="emoji">🚀</div>
          <h3>Our First Offer</h3>
          <p>Describe your first product or service here.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="emoji">💡</div>
          <h3>Our Second Offer</h3>
          <p>Explain another way your business helps people.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="emoji">⭐</div>
          <h3>Our Third Offer</h3>
          <p>Add another product, service, or special feature.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        At BrightStart, we're excited to turn ideas into
        something useful. Our goal is to offer a great
        experience and build something our customers love.
        Replace this text with your own business story.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
        <p>Have a question? Get in touch with us.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button"
         href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@example.com?subject=Business%20Inquiry">
        Contact Us
      </a>
      <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:14px;margin-top:15px">
        Replace the example email with your business email.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p><strong>BrightStart.</strong></p>
    <p>© <span id="year"></span> BrightStart. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
